{"body": "At the beginning of every federal fiscal year, the United States Department of Agriculture\u2019s Food and Nutrition Service (USDA FNS) adjusts maximum SNAP benefits, deductions, and income eligibility standards. These adjustments are known as the \u201cSNAP COLA.\u201d The SNAP COLA is based on changes in the cost of living and takes effect on October 1st of each year.\n\nThe standard utility allowances (SUAs) are updated annually to coincide with the COLA.\n\nThe annual SNAP COLA was processed during the weekend of September 20, 2025. The new COLA figures will be applied to the entire SNAP caseload. This recalculation will impact benefits beginning in October.\n\nEffective October 1, 2025, the COLA will be as follows:", "citation_label": "Massachusetts DTA Policy Online SNAP Annual Cost-of-Living Adjustment 2025 2", "citation_path": "us-ma/guidance/dta/policy-online/snap-cola/2025-10-01/block-2", "document_class": "guidance", "expression_date": "2025-11-17", "heading": "SNAP Annual Cost-of-Living Adjustment (COLA)", "id": "1c03504c-e22c-5f4d-8083-b8311df99a86", "jurisdiction": "us-ma", "kind": "block", "language": "en", "level": 2, "metadata": {"block_count": 18, "content_type": "text/html", "document_subtype": "agency_policy_online_guidance", "download_url": "https://eohhs.ehs.state.ma.us/DTA/PolicyOnline/BEACON5/%21SSL%21/WebHelp/ScheduledMailings/SMP_SNAP_COLA.htm?agt=index", "effective_date": "2025-10-01", "kind": "block", "official_publisher": "Massachusetts Department of Transitional Assistance Policy Online", "primary_source": true, "program": "SNAP", "source_authority": "Massachusetts Department of Transitional Assistance", "source_url": "https://eohhs.ehs.state.ma.us/DTA/PolicyOnline/BEACON5/%21SSL%21/WebHelp/ScheduledMailings/SMP_SNAP_COLA.htm?agt=index", "title": "Massachusetts DTA Policy Online SNAP Annual Cost-of-Living Adjustment 2025"}, "ordinal": 2, "parent_citation_path": "us-ma/guidance/dta/policy-online/snap-cola/2025-10-01", "parent_id": "60662d7e-98fb-553a-b358-2cab521dc64c", "source_as_of": "2025-11-17", "source_format": "html", "source_id": "ma-dta-policy-online-snap-cola-2025-10-01", "source_path": "sources/us-ma/guidance/2026-08-03-ma-dta-snap-cola-official-source-recovery/official-documents/ma-dta-policy-online-snap-cola-2025-10-01.html", "source_url": "https://eohhs.ehs.state.ma.us/DTA/PolicyOnline/BEACON5/%21SSL%21/WebHelp/ScheduledMailings/SMP_SNAP_COLA.htm?agt=index", "version": "2026-08-03-ma-dta-snap-cola-official-source-recovery"}
